# PET branded title slide

When building or revising **Psychopathology & Synthesis** (or related PET) PowerPoint decks via script:

- Use **`Powerpoint Synthesis/PET PowerPoint Title page.pptx`** as the presentation source so **slide 1** matches the official PET title layout (image strip, teal title band, date bar, Trust logo).
- Open that file, **remove any extra sample slides** after the first slide, then **set only the title and subtitle placeholder text** on slide 1. Do **not** reapply generic Calibri sizing to the title slide text (preserve slide master / branding).
- **Versioning:** this deck line is **V4.x** (current export **V4.1**); next scripted export should be **V4.2**, not V5/V7.

Content template continues to use `slide_layouts[1]`, `[2]`, `[5]` etc. from the same file after trim.
